## Why This Is Asked

Auditors require end-to-end data provenance in KCNA with tenant isolation, cryptographic integrity, and scalable verification. This question tests how to design lightweight, verifiable lineage without payload leakage and how to handle dynamic rotation and maintenance under failure.

## Key Concepts

